<table height="400" width="550" cellpadding="5" border="0" cellspacing="5" >
<tr height="400" valign="top" >
<td style=" color:#000000; font-size:12pt; background-color:#FFFFFF; font-family:arial; bLabel:main; bEditID:r3st1;" tEditID="c1r1" locked="0" aEditID="c1r1" >
<![CDATA[<div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Hello&nbsp;{!Contact.FirstName}</font><span style="font-family: arial;">,</span></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">I am sorry to hear that you will not be joining us this upcoming semester. I wish you the best of luck in your future endeavors.&nbsp;</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Please take a quick moment to officially <a href="https://students.asu.edu/canceladmissions">cancel your admission</a>. This will remove you from the system and from all call and email lists.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">By submitting your request to cancel your admission, you are also cancelling any housing assignment and any financial awards (including scholarships). Be aware that you will still be responsible for any non-refundable housing charges or other university charges you may have incurred. You can view your account and pay any charges by signing in to <a href="http://my.asu.edu">My ASU</a>.</font></div><div><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial">Thank you for considering ASU during your college search.</font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial">Sincerely,&nbsp;</font></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><font face="arial"><br></font></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;"><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Recruiter_Full_Name__c}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Recruiter_Title__c}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">Admission Services</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Recruiter_Email__c}</div><div style="font-size: 12pt;">{!User.Recruiter_Phone__c}</div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div><div><div style="font-family: 'Times New Roman'; font-size: medium;"><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">If you would like any additional information or have questions related to this subject, please reply to this email.</font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666"><br></font></div><div><font face="arial" size="2" color="#666666">{!Case.Thread_Id}</font></div></div></div><div style="color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: arial; font-size: 12pt;"><br></div>]]></td>
</tr>
</table>